    "turn_text": "That's right. And this week's conversation, Brian, we are asking, why is it so dangerous to have Black babies in America? I should say to carry and deliver Black babies in America specifically. Like, babies in America don't do too great as it is because of this whole system we've designed. But specifically today, we're talking about pregnancy, delivery, and everything that comes after it.",
